@startuml organization-capability-boundary
title Organization / Capability Boundary ; per ADR-ES-022 section 9

skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center

class "Organization" as Org
class "Capability" as Cap

Org --> Cap : exercises
Org -[dotted]- Cap : is NOT
Cap -[dotted]- Org : is NOT

note right
  Per ADR-ES-022 section 9:
  Organization exercises Capability. A Capability is exercised by
  an Organization, but an Organization is NOT a Capability.
end note

@enduml
